0.01: New app! Beep test on a 20m or 15m course with vibration cues, a clock widget while it runs, HR logging, optional GPS speed, TCX/CSV export
0.02: Shorter vibrations, two buzzes (not three) at each new level, 3 s countdown, the watch locks as usual during a test, tap the clock widget to go back to the test
0.03: Fixes: a flat battery or restart mid-test no longer saves a full 21.16, the TCX/CSV export ends at the stop press (laps were wrong after Stop & save), a full storage can't stop the cues, two results with the same day and score both show in Results, Cancel then No keeps the stop time, the download page marks the test in progress, the phone setting the clock mid-test no longer makes the test jump
0.04: Target speed (km/h) shown big next to heart rate during a test, with the distance underneath; stronger (longer) vibration cues, three buzzes at each new level
